(7718819, 1269529, 173844, '<td valign="top">Foam and fish, golden water and dark, speckled rock, fulfill the challenge.  That''s just to begin.  There''s a primitive, mythical, biblical feel to this image. The various elements scatter about in an unusual composition, but enjoyable.  It''s an unrolled scroll affording a glimpse of the immensity of time.  Beautiful.<br/>Co-second favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'Foam and fish, golden water and dark, speckled rock, fulfill the challenge.  That''s just to begin.  There''s a primitive, mythical, biblical feel to this image. The various elements scatter about in an unusual composition, but enjoyable.  It''s an unrolled scroll affording a glimpse of the immensity of time.  Beautiful.Co-second favorite of the challenge.', '2022-04-18 00:24:29.000000', NULL, 1),
