(7718857, 1269603, 50695, '<td valign="top">I was actually thinking of this photo, which turns out was Robert Freeman, not Astrid:<br/> <br/><a href="https://static01.nyt.com/images/2019/11/13/obituaries/11Freeman-sub/11Freeman-sub-superJumbo.jpg?quality=75&amp;auto=webp" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">https://static01.nyt.com/images/2019/11/13/obituaries/11Freeman-sub/11Freeman-sub-superJumbo.jpg?quality=75&amp;auto=webp</a> <br/> <br/>I had read somewhere that Astrid did side lighting like that, but I could be misremembering.</td>', 'I was actually thinking of this photo, which turns out was Robert Freeman, not Astrid: https://static01.nyt.com/images/2019/11/13/obituaries/11Freeman-sub/11Freeman-sub-superJumbo.jpg?quality=75&auto=webp  I had read somewhere that Astrid did side lighting like that, but I could be misremembering.', '2022-04-18 15:20:07.000000', NULL, 0),
